  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Frigid_Orok_Runt.jpg\" title=\"Frigid Orok Runt\"><img alt=\"Frigid Orok Runt\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"266\" src=\"/images/Frigid_Orok_Runt.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Frigid_Orok_Runt.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Frigid Orok Runt</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Orok\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranger\n</p><p>Orok Scouts are smaller in size compared to some of the other Oroks.  They use crossbows for ranged attacking and are usually found supporting a groups of <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warriors</a>. The Poison variety are capable of using a poison shot like attack that deals damage over time.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Scout\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Orok Ranger\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Ranger\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Scout\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Subterrorania</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Arborgeddon</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Haterium</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Orok Scout\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Orok Ranger\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frigid Orok Runt*\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Cave Peon\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Runt*\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Notes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>*There is one Orok Scout that is named Frigid Orok Runt, not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Runt/Orok Spawn</a>\n</p><p>*There is one Orok Scout that is named Divine Runt, not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Spawn\" title=\"Orok Spawn\">Orok Runt/Orok Spawn</a>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
